{"2369850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dolven", "steam_appid": 2369850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dolven is a narrative-driven tactical RPG where combat fuses party-based skills with poker-style card combos and deckbuilding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark fantasy world, you command a band of mercenaries against the Dungeon Master who rules each cursed dungeon. Battles unfold on a grid-based battlefield where positioning, timing, and strategy are as important as the hand of fate you hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/40415567a9d886426ee794057f2946da.avif?t=1765321762\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A First-of-Its-Kind Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of <i>Dolven</i> lies a unique blend of classic RPG combat and poker-inspired deckbuilding.<br>Your mercenaries wield swords, bows, and spells through traditional RPG abilities with additional buffs coming from the cards in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form poker-style combinations called a 'Rune Combo' such as pairs, straights, and flushes to earn extra mana with which to unlock more cards, empowering your party to turn the tide of battle. Every duel is more than a clash of steel—it’s a contest against the Dungeon Master himself, with you as his opponent, that's two dungeon masters facing off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/c7f13f06124a5123e8545aa9cb180bfa.avif?t=1765321762\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Fantasy Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dolven</i> is more than a dungeon crawl. It is a battle against the Dungeon Master, a struggle against fate, and a journey into the heart of a dark fantasy curse in the search for a missing girl.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Stronghold</strong>, the werewolf <strong>Witherfang</strong> hides a chilling secret...and a missing child.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Freewood Forest</strong>, twisted fairytale creatures obey the cruel will of <strong>Atrisia Ven</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the icy peaks, you’ll face <strong>Drulk the Ogre</strong> and his band of brutish misfits—watch out, he’s hungering for fresh meat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you survive these trials, your path will lead you to <strong>Yongul</strong>, a figure cloaked in power and secrets. He is not what he seems—and when his truth is revealed, you must decide what fate awaits Dolven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break the curse, or be consumed by it?<br>Will you find the girl—or lose her to the darkness?<br>Will you honor your oath—or betray it for a greater cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ed391e5aaa5bb7710013dd82e82aaaeb.avif?t=1765321762\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices That Shape Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinct endings—and a final, hidden reckoning only the bold will uncover—<i>Dolven</i> is a tale of loyalty and betrayal, of curses and crowns, and of the impossible choices that decide whether darkness endures… or is finally broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/b367267680981f1287cef75c08c37702.avif?t=1765321762\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilding &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players construct a deck made up of two main card types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenary Cards</strong> – Summon warriors, rogues, and mages to the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Cards</strong> – Cast magical effects, buffs, debuffs, or alter the battlefield itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card belongs to one of three archetypes—<strong>Strength (Red), Dexterity (Green), or Intelligence (Blue).</strong><br>Arrange Mercenary cards on the Pillars to form hands like pairs, flushes, or straight flushes. The in-game Compendium lists every possible combo and the rewards they bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle through Dolven’s maze of dungeons, you’ll customize your deck and collect gear to prepare for deadlier enemies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.poster.avif?t=1765321762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.webm?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.mp4?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical RPG Combat</strong> – Command your party on a grid-based battlefield, combining movement, positioning, and class abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poker-Style Card Combos</strong> – Form hands like pairs, straights, and flushes to unleash explosive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Master Duels</strong> – Each dungeon is ruled by a powerful Dungeon Master who fights back, shaping the battlefield against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Narrative</strong> – Unravel the necromancer’s curse through quests steeped in lore, prophecy, and choice-driven outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Customization</strong> – Build your deck, recruit mercenaries across three archetypes, and tailor your strategy to the enemies ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.poster.avif?t=1765321762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.webm?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.mp4?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Dungeon Master invites you to a Dual, the Quest Begins Now!  Who will stand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dolven is a narrative-driven tactical RPG where combat fuses party-based skills with poker-style card combos and deckbuilding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark fantasy world, you command a band of mercenaries against the Dungeon Master who rules each cursed dungeon. Battles unfold on a grid-based battlefield where positioning, timing, and strategy are as important as the hand of fate you hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/40415567a9d886426ee794057f2946da.avif?t=1765321762\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A First-of-Its-Kind Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of <i>Dolven</i> lies a unique blend of classic RPG combat and poker-inspired deckbuilding.<br>Your mercenaries wield swords, bows, and spells through traditional RPG abilities with additional buffs coming from the cards in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form poker-style combinations called a 'Rune Combo' such as pairs, straights, and flushes to earn extra mana with which to unlock more cards, empowering your party to turn the tide of battle. Every duel is more than a clash of steel—it’s a contest against the Dungeon Master himself, with you as his opponent, that's two dungeon masters facing off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/c7f13f06124a5123e8545aa9cb180bfa.avif?t=1765321762\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Fantasy Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dolven</i> is more than a dungeon crawl. It is a battle against the Dungeon Master, a struggle against fate, and a journey into the heart of a dark fantasy curse in the search for a missing girl.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Stronghold</strong>, the werewolf <strong>Witherfang</strong> hides a chilling secret...and a missing child.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Freewood Forest</strong>, twisted fairytale creatures obey the cruel will of <strong>Atrisia Ven</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the icy peaks, you’ll face <strong>Drulk the Ogre</strong> and his band of brutish misfits—watch out, he’s hungering for fresh meat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you survive these trials, your path will lead you to <strong>Yongul</strong>, a figure cloaked in power and secrets. He is not what he seems—and when his truth is revealed, you must decide what fate awaits Dolven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break the curse, or be consumed by it?<br>Will you find the girl—or lose her to the darkness?<br>Will you honor your oath—or betray it for a greater cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ed391e5aaa5bb7710013dd82e82aaaeb.avif?t=1765321762\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices That Shape Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinct endings—and a final, hidden reckoning only the bold will uncover—<i>Dolven</i> is a tale of loyalty and betrayal, of curses and crowns, and of the impossible choices that decide whether darkness endures… or is finally broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/b367267680981f1287cef75c08c37702.avif?t=1765321762\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilding &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players construct a deck made up of two main card types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenary Cards</strong> – Summon warriors, rogues, and mages to the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Cards</strong> – Cast magical effects, buffs, debuffs, or alter the battlefield itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card belongs to one of three archetypes—<strong>Strength (Red), Dexterity (Green), or Intelligence (Blue).</strong><br>Arrange Mercenary cards on the Pillars to form hands like pairs, flushes, or straight flushes. The in-game Compendium lists every possible combo and the rewards they bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle through Dolven’s maze of dungeons, you’ll customize your deck and collect gear to prepare for deadlier enemies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.poster.avif?t=1765321762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.webm?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.mp4?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical RPG Combat</strong> – Command your party on a grid-based battlefield, combining movement, positioning, and class abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poker-Style Card Combos</strong> – Form hands like pairs, straights, and flushes to unleash explosive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Master Duels</strong> – Each dungeon is ruled by a powerful Dungeon Master who fights back, shaping the battlefield against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Narrative</strong> – Unravel the necromancer’s curse through quests steeped in lore, prophecy, and choice-driven outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Customization</strong> – Build your deck, recruit mercenaries across three archetypes, and tailor your strategy to the enemies ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.poster.avif?t=1765321762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.webm?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.mp4?t=1765321762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Dungeon Master invites you to a Dual, the Quest Begins Now!  Who will stand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dolven is a narrative-driven tactical RPG where combat blends party-based skills with poker-style card combos. Command your mercenaries in grid-based battles against the dungeon master and his horde of the undead. Choices matter as you unravel the mystery of the necromancers curse.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "reviews": "“I found it to be engaging and gave me that just one more go feeling that I get from playing XCOM.”<br>Couch Soup - Rohan Elliott<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/d0723494303ef55d99d3cb9ba1123f57a3e61ed8/header.jpg?t=1765321762", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/936774c16cfef70b17ef09311467f79f53d7b6de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765321762", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/936774c16cfef70b17ef09311467f79f53d7b6de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765321762", "website": "https://www.dolvengame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Big Sur 11.0 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or later or Intel Core i5-2300 (2.8 GHz) or equivalent (e.g., 2nd generation Intel Core series or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Integrated Apple GPU or Integrated graphics with Metal support (e.g., Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better; no dedicated GPU required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong>  Native ARM64 support via Universal binary. Rosetta 2 is not required but can be used for compatibility if needed.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Covyne Entertainment", "The Kids From Yesterday"], "publishers": ["Covyne Entertainment"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1999, "final": 1999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$19.99"}, "packages": [851971], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Dolven", "description": "